  characterName: Anna
  description: Anna is a 29 year old married manager with a master's degree and a
    high income of 59,000 euros which protects her from stress. Mentally resilient
    and trauma-free, she is an occasional user who consumes alcohol and drugs purely
    for pleasure, choosing these vices freely rather than out of necessity.
